; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.32 on BTCUSD - rank 1: M3 both, session 0700-1200 server time, trend filter M15. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Backtest Jan 2025-May 2026 (Binance BTCUSDT M1, assumed spread 10 USD, risk-% sizing): 136 trades, PF 2.22, net +69R, max drawdown 4.0R. 2025 worse half-year PF 2.18; 2026 PF 2.14 (33 trades).
; Harsh stress (1 min late, pessimistic trailing, 3 USD slippage, 2 USD commission): PF 1.85; 2025 worse half 1.74; 2026 PF 1.80.
; Chosen with ALL the data: no unseen test. Across the whole BTC search a good 2025 did not predict 2026 (median 2026 PF about 1.0).
; UNPROVEN: Strategy Tester (real ticks) and demo only. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD. MaxSpread_Points=3000 allows a 30 USD spread.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7h). The weekend close is off: BTC trades through the weekend at most brokers.
